    "body": "<section id=\"photos\" class=\"kk-photos\" aria-labelledby=\"kk-photos-title\">\n<style>\n.kk-photos{max-width:100%}\n.kk-photos .kk-ph-inner{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}\n.kk-photos h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,6vw,2.4rem);color:var(--j2-primary)}\n.kk-photos .kk-ph-intro{margin:0 0 24px;max-width:36em;color:var(--j2-muted)}\n.kk-photos .kk-ph-grid{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px}\n@media (min-width:480px){.kk-photos .kk-ph-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media (min-width:900px){.kk-photos .kk-ph-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px}}\n.kk-photos .kk-ph-item{min-width:0;margin:0}\n.kk-photos .j2-card{min-width:0;padding:12px}\n.kk-photos .kk-ph-spot{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4 / 3;padding:16px;text-align:center;border:2px dashed var(--j2-muted);border-radius:var(--j2-radius);background:var(--j2-background);color:var(--j2-muted)}\n.kk-photos .kk-ph-icon{width:40px;height:40px;flex:none}\n.kk-photos .kk-ph-flag{margin:0;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--j2-muted)}\n.kk-photos .kk-ph-name{margin:12px 0 0;font-family:var(--j2-font-heading);font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--j2-secondary)}\n.kk-photos .kk-ph-note{margin:24px 0 0;padding:8px 12px;border-left:4px solid var(--j2-accent);background:var(--j2-surface);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;color:var(--j2-text)}\n</style>\n<div class=\"kk-ph-inner\">\n  <h2 id=\"kk-photos-title\">Dish photos</h2>\n  <p class=\"kk-ph-intro\">Photos of our dishes are on their way. The empty spots below are where they will appear.</p>\n  <!-- To add a real photo later: replace the div.kk-ph-spot inside an item with <img src=\"...\" alt=\"Dish name\"> and remove the \"Empty photo spot\" text. -->\n  <ul class=\"kk-ph-grid\">\n    <li class=\"kk-ph-item\">\n      <div class=\"j2-card\">\n        <div class=\"kk-ph-spot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Empty photo spot for Masala dosa. Photo coming soon.\">\n          <svg class=\"kk-ph-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h3l1.5-2h7L17 8h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"3.5\"/></svg>\n          <p class=\"kk-ph-flag\">Empty photo spot</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"kk-ph-name\">Masala dosa</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"kk-ph-item\">\n      <div class=\"j2-card\">\n        <div class=\"kk-ph-spot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Empty photo spot for Mysore dosa. Photo coming soon.\">\n          <svg class=\"kk-ph-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h3l1.5-2h7L17 8h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"3.5\"/></svg>\n          <p class=\"kk-ph-flag\">Empty photo spot</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"kk-ph-name\">Mysore dosa</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"kk-ph-item\">\n      <div class=\"j2-card\">\n        <div class=\"kk-ph-spot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Empty photo spot for Idli sambar. Photo coming soon.\">\n          <svg class=\"kk-ph-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h3l1.5-2h7L17 8h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"3.5\"/></svg>\n          <p class=\"kk-ph-flag\">Empty photo spot</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"kk-ph-name\">Idli sambar</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"kk-ph-item\">\n      <div class=\"j2-card\">\n        <div class=\"kk-ph-spot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Empty photo spot for Veg thali. Photo coming soon.\">\n          <svg class=\"kk-ph-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h3l1.5-2h7L17 8h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"3.5\"/></svg>\n          <p class=\"kk-ph-flag\">Empty photo spot</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"kk-ph-name\">Veg thali</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"kk-ph-item\">\n      <div class=\"j2-card\">\n        <div class=\"kk-ph-spot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Empty photo spot for Fish curry meal. Photo coming soon.\">\n          <svg class=\"kk-ph-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h3l1.5-2h7L17 8h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"3.5\"/></svg>\n          <p class=\"kk-ph-flag\">Empty photo spot</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"kk-ph-name\">Fish curry meal</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"kk-ph-item\">\n      <div class=\"j2-card\">\n        <div class=\"kk-ph-spot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Empty photo spot for Filter coffee. Photo coming soon.\">\n          <svg class=\"kk-ph-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h3l1.5-2h7L17 8h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"3.5\"/></svg>\n          <p class=\"kk-ph-flag\">Empty photo spot</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"kk-ph-name\">Filter coffee</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"kk-ph-note\">Real photos of our dishes will be added here soon.</p>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "workflow": "Dish photo placeholders"
  },
  "W-7": {
